<item><hi rendition="#aq">War in disgui&#x017F;e or the frauds of the neutral flags. London</hi><lb/>
1806. Unverhohlne Britti&#x017F;che Seerechts-Orthodoxie, &#x017F;elb&#x017F;t<lb/>
